{
  "slug": "meetstream-ai-meeting-bot-api",
  "name": "Meetstream Ai Meeting Bot Api",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build meeting bot integrations without writing boilerplate. MeetStream lets developers programmatically join, record,\ntranscribe, and stream Zoom, Google Meet, and Microsoft Teams meetings via a REST API. This plugin gives Claude full\nknowledge of the MeetStream API - bot lifecycle, transcription providers, real-time WebSocket streaming, calendar\nautomation, and webhook handling - so it generates complete, production-ready code tailored to your use case.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `calendar-automation` (Build Google Calendar-driven meeting automation on MeetStream — connect a Google Calendar once and a bot auto-joins every…), `getting-started` (First-time setup for MeetStream — guides a brand-new user through account signup, API key creation, environment configuration, and…), `meetstream` (Core MeetStream API reference, lifecycle, decision tree, and live-verified endpoint catalog), `migrate-from-recall` (Migrate an existing Recall.ai integration to MeetStream — rewrite base URLs, endpoints, request fields, and webhook handlers), `notetaker` (Build a complete MeetStream-powered AI meeting notetaker — bot joins, records, transcribes, generates an AI summary, and emails…), `sales-coach` (Build a real-time AI sales coaching tool on MeetStream — live transcription streams to a server that detects…), `test-bot` (Send a single test bot to a live meeting and stream every webhook event to the terminal in…), `verify-account` (Verify a MeetStream account's configuration before building)\n- **Agents** (1): `meetstream-debugger` (Focused debugger for MeetStream bot failures)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install meetstream-ai-meeting-bot-api@claude-community` from `meetstream-ai/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "agent": 1
  },
